MeiloX QQ Music Source
Copyright 2026 MeiloX contributors.

This independently implemented adapter was first developed in samples/qq-music-source
of https://github.com/NEORUAA/MeiloX and is maintained here as a separate plugin.
Its host contract follows the MeiloX source SDK.

