QQ Music trademarks and projected public catalog metadata remain with their owners.
The fixed QQ OAuth login recipe and credential names follow QQ Music's public
common.chunk.5b378f933e2203b7da48.js and official HTTPS OAuth/callback pages.
The QR login entry uses the official Graph show?which=Login wrapper and its
style-40 XUI iframe, with the y.qq.com/wx_redirect callback, Graph login_jump
return target and full-height official QR flow.
Mobile login and artwork resource grants use maintained official-root QQ, GTimg
(`*.gtimg.com`/`*.gtimg.cn`), CDN-go, Qpic
and idqqimg subtrees, covering the public XUI page, connect.qq.com return target,
and jsapi/open.mobile.qq.com script resources; the wildcard also covers any
official connect.qq.com transition.
Cookie extraction remains concrete and limited to the y.qq/i2 callback plus
Graph/XUI/QQ authorization hosts; intermediate pt_* names remain excluded.
No QQ Music login-page code is bundled; the host opens those official pages.
QQ audio resources use the declared *.stream.qqmusic.qq.com subtree; the source
and host enforce its DNS-label boundary without forwarding account Cookies.

